{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"The presentation now has shaded saucers, distinct enemy silhouettes, orbital shield beads, and a fixed arena that fits each screen. The networking adapter has passed its targeted lifecycle tests; next I’m connecting the screens and controls so the full game can run in the packaged HTML.\n"}}
