{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_69","type":"agent_message","text":"Controller and touch checks are passing. Testing caught and fixed quick fire taps being lost between updates; the full co-op simulation also proves a rescue followed by victory with one surviving pilot. I’m running the consolidated suite now, then I’ll fill in the final feedback and rebuild the delivery file.\n"}}
